{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Speed Rally \u2013 Classic Arcade Racing, Reimagined!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed Rally</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired top-down arcade racer that brings back the golden era of single-button gaming. Whether you're chasing <strong>online high scores</strong> or battling friends in <strong>local multiplayer</strong>, Speed Rally delivers an exciting, pick-up-and-play racing experience that\u2019s easy to learn but hard to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race Across Diverse Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete on a variety of tracks set in <strong>woodlands, deserts, and tropical islands</strong>. Choose from different car models and put your skills to the test in <strong>CPU races</strong> or <strong>time trial mode</strong>, where every millisecond counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on a friend in <strong>local multiplayer</strong> with two exciting modes. Play in <strong>split-screen</strong> or crank up the intensity with <strong>Penalty Mode</strong>, where both players race on the same screen\u2014fall too far behind, and you're out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself to master every track and push for the fastest lap times. Can you claim the top spot and become the ultimate Speed Rally champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump in and start racing today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502370?t=1751227079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502370?t=1751227079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502370/2cf37cc9615e0553a3cdf00da352fb7e5bebc02c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751227079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a